{
 "id": "asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel",
 "title": "What will I use to travel?",
 "pages": [
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/02.webp",
   "text": "There are many ways to travel. Which will I choose?"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/03.webp",
   "text": "Should I use a plane?"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/04.webp",
   "text": "Planes fly very high. I am afraid of flying!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/05.webp",
   "text": "Perhaps I should use a helcopter?"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/06.webp",
   "text": "But helicopters and planes are the same!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/07.webp",
   "text": "Should I perhaps use a train?"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/08.webp",
   "text": "But the train station is very far."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/09.webp",
   "text": "Or, perhaps, I should use a bus?"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/10.webp",
   "text": "Our village has only one bus!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/11.webp",
   "text": "Perhaps I will use a lorry to travel."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/12.webp",
   "text": "But lorries are used for carrying heavy luggage."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/13.webp",
   "text": "Should I use a bicycle to travel?"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/14.webp",
   "text": "But will my father give me his bicycle?"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/15.webp",
   "text": "Perhaps I will try to use a boat?"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/16.webp",
   "text": "But I do not trust boats very much!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-what-will-i-use-to-travel/17.webp",
   "text": "Aah! I know how I will travel! I will use a tractor."
  }
 ],
 "words": 122,
